# Reson8 behind Caddy: automatic HTTPS (Let's Encrypt), HTTP/2 and HTTP/3.
#
# Used by docker-compose.caddy.yml. RESON8_DOMAIN is the public name of the
# server (its DNS record must already point at this machine, and ports 80 and
# 443 must be reachable from the internet for the certificate to be issued).
#
# Caddy proxies WebSocket upgrades (Socket.io) on its own and sets
# X-Forwarded-For / X-Forwarded-Proto. Voice and screen-share media never goes
# through here: mediasoup's UDP/TCP ports stay published on the server itself.
{$RESON8_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy reson8-server:9800
}
